              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are given an array of clause-level data objects.\n\nDATA: {{$context.$nodes.MAP_CLAUSE_TITLE_AND_ISSUES.$output.result}}\n\nTASK\nFor each doc_clause_title, generate a synthesized clause-level deviation_summary from the combined issue-level change request summaries.\n\nSTRICT RULES\n- Summarize only requested changes from deviation_summary input.\n- Do NOT compare against standard position, fallback position, baseline, policy, or template language.\n- Do NOT use phrases like: \"instead of\", \"compared to\", \"deviates from\", \"lower/higher than standard\", \"fallback\", \"standard position\".\n- Do NOT mention risk, approval, or compliance outcomes.\n- Produce a concise synthesized summary, not a copy/merge of input text.\n- 1 to 3 sentences maximum.\n- Do not use numbering/bullets.\n- Ignore formatting-only noise (newlines, tabs, repeated spaces, special symbols).\n- If input for a clause is empty, return an empty string for deviation_summary.\n\nOUTPUT\nReturn valid JSON array only:\n[\n  {\n    \"doc_clause_title\": \"<string>\",\n    \"deviation_summary\": \"<string>\"\n  }\n]\nNo extra text."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1775457700543",
          "code": "GENERATE_STANDARD_POSITION_SUMMARY_FOR_ISSUES",
          "type": "LLM",
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Standard Position Summary for Issues",
            "description": "Generates clause-level summaries of standard policy positions for matched issues.",
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "code": "ORA_MODEL_CONFIG_PREMIUM_OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "modelName": "Gpt-5 Mini",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM",
